{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52247","headline":"诗（幷序） 八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沉沦三恶道，家内无人知。\n有衣不能着，有马不能骑。\n有奴不能使，有婢不相随。\n有食不能吃，向前恒受饥。\n冥冥地狱苦，难见出头时。\n依巡（一作「相逐」）次第去，却活知有谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}